{"id":"4556d49b2cf20f7f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/512_Coherent_constructive_logic.md","title":"512 Coherent constructive logic","display":"512_Coherent_constructive_logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h2 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h2>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>一阶签名为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{512}=(\\mathcal F_{512},\\mathcal R_{512},\\operatorname{arF}_{512},\\operatorname{arR}_{512}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_{512}=(\\mathcal F_{512},\\mathcal R_{512},\\operatorname{arF}_{512},\\operatorname{arR}_{512}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{arF}_{512}:\\mathcal F_{512}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{arF}_{512}:\\mathcal F_{512}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{arR}_{512}:\\mathcal R_{512}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{arR}_{512}:\\mathcal R_{512}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。变量集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}_{512}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}_{512}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.-项与-coherent-公式\">2. 项与 coherent 公式</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{512}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{512}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal F_{512}\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal F_{512}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{arF}_{512}(f)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{arF}_{512}(f)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\">\\(\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\">\\(\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>coherent 公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\">\\(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=u\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\">\\(t=u\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal R_{512}\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal R_{512}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{arR}_{512}(R)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{arR}_{512}(R)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\">\\(\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\">\\(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\">\\(\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B,A\\lor B\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\">\\(A\\land B,A\\lor B\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{512}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{512}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists xA\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\">\\(\\exists xA\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>原始 coherent 公式中没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\">\\(\\forall\\)</span> 构造子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变量、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h2>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{512}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{512}:\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{512}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{512}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{512}:\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{512}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}(\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}(\\tau(i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}(\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}(\\tau(i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(t=u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}(u),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}(\\tau(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(t=u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}(u),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}(\\tau(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(\\exists xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(\\exists xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{512}:\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{512})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{512}:\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{512})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(t=u)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(\\top)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(t=u)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(\\top)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(\\exists xA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(\\exists xA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限公式集定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(\\Gamma)=\\bigcup_{A\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(\\Gamma)=\\bigcup_{A\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subt}_{512}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{512}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Subt}_{512}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{512}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>在变量与函数项上定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subt}_{512}(\\operatorname{var}(y),x,t)=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Subt}_{512}(\\operatorname{var}(y),x,t)=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subt}_{512}(\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau),x,t)=\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau&#39;)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Subt}_{512}(\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau),x,t)=\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau&#39;)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau&#39;(i)=\\operatorname{Subt}_{512}(\\tau(i),x,t)\">\\(\\tau&#39;(i)=\\operatorname{Subt}_{512}(\\tau(i),x,t)\\)</span>。公式替换在等词、关系原子、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land\">\\(\\land\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lor\">\\(\\lor\\)</span> 上替换参数或子式；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists yA\">\\(\\exists yA\\)</span> 处使用 fresh 函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{512}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{512})\\to\\mathsf{Var}_{512},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fresh}_{512}(X)=v_m,\\quad\nm=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{512}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{512})\\to\\mathsf{Var}_{512},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fresh}_{512}(X)=v_m,\\quad\nm=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给出无捕获结果。正式地，公式替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}:\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{512}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\\to\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}:\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{512}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{512}\\to\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(s=u,x,t)=\n(\\operatorname{Subt}_{512}(s,x,t)=\\operatorname{Subt}_{512}(u,x,t)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(s=u,x,t)=\n(\\operatorname{Subt}_{512}(s,x,t)=\\operatorname{Subt}_{512}(u,x,t)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau),x,t)\n=\n\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau&#39;)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau),x,t)\n=\n\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau&#39;)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau&#39;(i)=\\operatorname{Subt}_{512}(\\tau(i),x,t)\">\\(\\tau&#39;(i)=\\operatorname{Subt}_{512}(\\tau(i),x,t)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(\\top,x,t)=\\top,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(\\bot,x,t)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(\\top,x,t)=\\top,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(\\bot,x,t)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(A\\land B,x,t)\n=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(A,x,t)\\land\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(B,x,t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(A\\land B,x,t)\n=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(A,x,t)\\land\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(B,x,t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(A\\lor B,x,t)\n=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(A,x,t)\\lor\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(B,x,t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(A\\lor B,x,t)\n=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(A,x,t)\\lor\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(B,x,t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(\\exists yA,x,t)=\\exists yA\n\\quad(y=x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(\\exists yA,x,t)=\\exists yA\n\\quad(y=x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(\\exists yA,x,t)\n=\n\\exists y\\,\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(A,x,t)\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}(t)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(\\exists yA,x,t)\n=\n\\exists y\\,\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(A,x,t)\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}(t)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x\">\\(y\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}(t)\">\\(y\\in\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}(t)\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{512}(\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{512}(\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{512}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(\\exists yA,x,t)\n=\n\\exists z\\,\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(A,y,\\operatorname{var}(z)),x,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(\\exists yA,x,t)\n=\n\\exists z\\,\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(A,y,\\operatorname{var}(z)),x,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,512}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\times\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_{\\alpha,512}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\times\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为所有满足下列条件的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\times\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\">\\(E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\times\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\)</span> 的交集：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\">\\(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\)</span> 上的等价关系。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,A&#39;),(B,B&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A,A&#39;),(B,B&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\land B,A&#39;\\land B&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A\\land B,A&#39;\\land B&#39;)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\lor B,A&#39;\\lor B&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A\\lor B,A&#39;\\lor B&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,A&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A,A&#39;)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{512}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{512}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\exists xA,\\exists xA&#39;)\\in E\">\\((\\exists xA,\\exists xA&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{512}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{512}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(A)\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{512}(A)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\exists xA,\\exists y\\,\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(A,x,\\operatorname{var}(y)))\\in E\">\\((\\exists xA,\\exists y\\,\\operatorname{Sub}_{512}(A,x,\\operatorname{var}(y)))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"4.-相继式与规则关系\">4. 相继式与规则关系</h2>\n<p>相继式集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_{512}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,\\Delta):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}_{512}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,\\Delta):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\)</span>。前件与后件都是有限集合，故本系统明确采用有限多结论 succedent；交换、收缩由集合相等内建，规则中的任意环境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\)</span> 内建左右弱化。规则关系如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxSeq}_{Id}^{512}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},\\Delta\\cup\\{A\\}):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),A\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxSeq}_{Id}^{512}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},\\Delta\\cup\\{A\\}):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),A\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Id}^{512}\n=\n\\{((\\,),S):S\\in\\mathsf{AxSeq}_{Id}^{512}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Id}^{512}\n=\n\\{((\\,),S):S\\in\\mathsf{AxSeq}_{Id}^{512}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\top R}^{512}\n=\n\\{((\\,),(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{\\top\\})):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512})\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\top R}^{512}\n=\n\\{((\\,),(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{\\top\\})):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512})\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot L}^{512}\n=\n\\{((\\,),(\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\Delta)):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot L}^{512}\n=\n\\{((\\,),(\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\Delta)):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Cut}^{512}\n=\n\\{(((\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{A\\}),(\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},\\Delta)),(\\Gamma,\\Delta)):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),A\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Cut}^{512}\n=\n\\{(((\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{A\\}),(\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},\\Delta)),(\\Gamma,\\Delta)):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),A\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>合取规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land L}^{512}\n=\n\\{(((\\Gamma\\cup\\{A,B\\},\\Delta)),(\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\land B\\},\\Delta)):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land L}^{512}\n=\n\\{(((\\Gamma\\cup\\{A,B\\},\\Delta)),(\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\land B\\},\\Delta)):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land R}^{512}\n=\n\\{(((\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{A\\}),(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{B\\})),(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{A\\land B\\})):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land R}^{512}\n=\n\\{(((\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{A\\}),(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{B\\})),(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{A\\land B\\})):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>析取规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor L}^{512}\n=\n\\{(((\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},\\Delta),(\\Gamma\\cup\\{B\\},\\Delta)),(\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\lor B\\},\\Delta)):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor L}^{512}\n=\n\\{(((\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},\\Delta),(\\Gamma\\cup\\{B\\},\\Delta)),(\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\lor B\\},\\Delta)):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor R}^{512}\n=\n\\{(((\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{A,B\\})),(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{A\\lor B\\})):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor R}^{512}\n=\n\\{(((\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{A,B\\})),(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{A\\lor B\\})):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>存在规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists R}^{512}\n=\n\\{(((\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{A[x:=t]\\})),(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{\\exists xA\\})):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{512},\\ t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{512},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512},\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512})\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists R}^{512}\n=\n\\{(((\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{A[x:=t]\\})),(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{\\exists xA\\})):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{512},\\ t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{512},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512},\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512})\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists L}^{512}\n=\n\\{(((\\Gamma\\cup\\{A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)]\\},\\Delta)),(\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\exists xA\\},\\Delta)):\nx,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{512},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512},\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),\ny\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(\\Gamma)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(\\Delta)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists L}^{512}\n=\n\\{(((\\Gamma\\cup\\{A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)]\\},\\Delta)),(\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\exists xA\\},\\Delta)):\nx,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{512},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512},\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),\ny\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(\\Gamma)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(\\Delta)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}_{512}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>相继式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-替换规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{512}\n={}&amp;\n\\left\\{\n\\bigl(\n((\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},\\Delta)),\n(\\Gamma\\cup\\{B\\},\\Delta)\n\\bigr):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),\\\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512},\\\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,512}B\n\\right\\}\n\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\n\\left\\{\n\\bigl(\n((\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{A\\})),\n(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{B\\})\n\\bigr):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),\\\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512},\\\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,512}B\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{512}\n={}&amp;\n\\left\\{\n\\bigl(\n((\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},\\Delta)),\n(\\Gamma\\cup\\{B\\},\\Delta)\n\\bigr):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),\\\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512},\\\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,512}B\n\\right\\}\n\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\n\\left\\{\n\\bigl(\n((\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{A\\})),\n(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\cup\\{B\\})\n\\bigr):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),\\\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512},\\\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,512}B\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.-证明树与可导性\">5. 证明树与可导性</h2>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{512}\">\\(S\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{512}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Deriv}_{512}(S)\">\\(\\mathsf{Deriv}_{512}(S)\\)</span> 是有限有根树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>，每个节点标记一个相继式，并满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>根节点标记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>叶节点的空前提到结论属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Id}^{512}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Id}^{512}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\top R}^{512}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\top R}^{512}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot L}^{512}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot L}^{512}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>每个非叶节点的子节点标记组成的有序有限列与该节点标记组成某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Cut}^{512}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Cut}^{512}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land L}^{512}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land L}^{512}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land R}^{512}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land R}^{512}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor L}^{512}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor L}^{512}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor R}^{512}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor R}^{512}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists L}^{512}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists L}^{512}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists R}^{512}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists R}^{512}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{512}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{512}\\)</span> 实例。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>在二前提规则中，子节点有序列的第一项对应规则定义中前提元组的第一项，第二项对应第二项；一前提规则的唯一子节点对应唯一前提。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{MainConseq}_{512}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A):\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),\nA\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512},\n\\mathsf{Deriv}_{512}((\\Gamma,\\{A\\}))\\ne\\varnothing\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{MainConseq}_{512}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A):\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),\nA\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512},\n\\mathsf{Deriv}_{512}((\\Gamma,\\{A\\}))\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{MainJud}_{512}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,T):\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),\nA\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512},\nT\\in\\mathsf{Deriv}_{512}((\\Gamma,\\{A\\}))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{MainJud}_{512}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,T):\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}),\nA\\in\\mathsf{Coh}_{512},\nT\\in\\mathsf{Deriv}_{512}((\\Gamma,\\{A\\}))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{512}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Deriv}_{512}((\\Gamma,\\{A\\}))\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{512}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Deriv}_{512}((\\Gamma,\\{A\\}))\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"6.-目标区分\">6. 目标区分</h2>\n<p>本条目的目标增量是 coherent 公式片段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\">\\(\\mathsf{Coh}_{512}\\)</span> 与有限集相继式规则；对象公式没有原始 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\">\\(\\forall\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"7.-整个句法形式系统\">7. 整个句法形式系统</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{Coherent}_{512}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma_{512},\\mathsf{Var}_{512},\\mathsf{Tm}_{512},\\mathsf{Coh}_{512},\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{512},\\operatorname{FV}_{512},\\operatorname{BV}_{512},\\operatorname{Subt}_{512},\\operatorname{Sub}_{512},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,512},\\mathsf{Seq}_{512},\n\\mathsf{AxSeq}_{Id}^{512},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Id}^{512},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\top R}^{512},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot L}^{512},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Cut}^{512},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land L}^{512},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land R}^{512},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor L}^{512},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor R}^{512},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists L}^{512},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists R}^{512},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{512},\n\\mathsf{Deriv}_{512},\\mathsf{MainConseq}_{512},\\mathsf{MainJud}_{512},\\vdash_{512}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{Coherent}_{512}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma_{512},\\mathsf{Var}_{512},\\mathsf{Tm}_{512},\\mathsf{Coh}_{512},\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{512},\\operatorname{FV}_{512},\\operatorname{BV}_{512},\\operatorname{Subt}_{512},\\operatorname{Sub}_{512},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,512},\\mathsf{Seq}_{512},\n\\mathsf{AxSeq}_{Id}^{512},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Id}^{512},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\top R}^{512},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot L}^{512},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Cut}^{512},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land L}^{512},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\land R}^{512},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor L}^{512},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\lor R}^{512},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists L}^{512},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists R}^{512},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{512},\n\\mathsf{Deriv}_{512},\\mathsf{MainConseq}_{512},\\mathsf{MainJud}_{512},\\vdash_{512}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含 coherent 项、公式、相继式、规则、有限证明树和可导性；不含范畴语义、模型、满足或有效性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":2},{"id":"2.-项与-coherent-公式","text":"2. 项与 coherent 公式","level":2},{"id":"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变量、替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":2},{"id":"4.-相继式与规则关系","text":"4. 相继式与规则关系","level":2},{"id":"5.-证明树与可导性","text":"5. 证明树与可导性","level":2},{"id":"6.-目标区分","text":"6. 目标区分","level":2},{"id":"7.-整个句法形式系统","text":"7. 整个句法形式系统","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\e